Z||000017||kempo||10-18-2001||12:05 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>I wouldnt race for that amount or for titles anyway, there are too many little things that can go wrong and make you lose.  To want to race for titles or that amount of money, you either are packing a way unstock fiero or you are just stupid.  I could easily hide a 50 hp nitrous shot under the exhaust manifold and blow you away if you're really stock.  In short, if you want to race for kicks fine, I'll take speck and you and everyone else on.  Bahahahaha. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks for the reply, because it was a serious question.  You're right about having something that I may not know about (the cheater NOS kit), but if you're so confident, then why refuse?  Maybe it's because I don't care much for money and it isn't an issue.  As for title for title, that is just how confient I am.  As far as my being stupid, I don't think so.  But, I must say, that you talk a good game, and just wish that you could back up your talk.  Racing for sh*ts and giggles is one thing, but why would you want to if you are so confident, as I am, about winning?  If I lost, you would get the title or $$, and the bragging rights you talk about as well.  As far as something going wrong, well, you did talk about making me spin out if I were to pull ahead of you.  I'd see this as a huge accomplishment as there would be a barrier between us, being on a closed circuit, legal race course.  I think that we'll just wait and see how you do in the upcoming race with Spektrum, as we all know that it should be a good one.  In advance, best of luck to you both!<BR>-Kemp||||reg||1
