Z||000035||BlackStang95||10-18-2001||12:48 PM||||Wow...a lot more flame posts, twisting of my words etc...I'll respond as best I can. <P>I'm not immature or unsafe at all...race at any condition?  I'm the one that didn't particularly want to race again, I ran dead even with his fiero gt and im proud of that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>All i ever said was a v-6 stang is about as fast as a v-6 fiero (stock vs stock) and thats the truth.  In that respect, me and my car have already backed up all the "trash talking" I've done.  <P>I don't have a damn thing to prove to anyone, lol. I totally agree this could have taken place on email or private message but Spek apprently feels very strongly he has something to prove, I don't know what his malfunction is.  <P>It's also interesting he started talking all this ****  the DAY after i told him about the leaking oil pan....hmm...<P>as for it being a 6 year old car, its actually a 94, had a 95 motor put in after the previous owner blew the original motor (very abusive life) and it has 130k miles on it...i dont feel bad about the differential or gasket being bad.<P>As for location we live in virginia near norfolk and va beach<P>nos bottle? i dont have nos, or anything non stock on my car, but its easy to do that or other internal engine mods, which is why its smart to never race someone for slips or big cash, i've seen rusty pick up trucks take new z28's...not to mention 12 second minivans<BR> <A HREF="http://webpages.krausonline.com/spaul/" TARGET=_blank>http://webpages.krausonline.com/spaul/</A> <P>Wait till i get this done is not BS, he said he wanted this to be totally fair and no excuses, its certainly not gonna be like that if parts are broken?<P>cheever..hospital bill? is that a threat? big words for someone in texas.  how bout those cowboys eh?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I agree we should all get along, and if you'd all give me a fair unbiased chance we could but oh well..